WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.534 --> 00:00:20.558
Ethan couldn't believe how cold it was outside.

2
00:00:20.559 --> 00:00:26.335
At recess he wore a sweater, coat, scarf, hat, and mittens.

3
00:00:26.336 --> 00:00:36.078
But he was still cold!

4
00:00:36.079 --> 00:00:38.729
"Today's activity is outside!

5
00:00:38.730 --> 00:00:43.361
Bundle up," Miss Shelly said as Ethan walked in the door.

6
00:00:43.362 --> 00:00:48.386
"Outside?" Ethan asked. "But it's freezing!"

7
00:00:48.387 --> 00:00:51.422
"It's fun," Bobby said.

8
00:00:51.423 --> 00:00:53.822
"You'll get used to it."

9
00:00:53.823 --> 00:00:56.507
Ethan didn't think it would be fun.

10
00:00:56.508 --> 00:01:00.295
But he zipped up his coat anyway.

11
00:01:00.296 --> 00:01:05.538
Outside, the ground was covered in snow from the snowstorm last night.

12
00:01:05.539 --> 00:01:09.018
Ethan walked carefully in his brand-new boots.

13
00:01:09.019 --> 00:01:11.868
He wasn't used to walking in the snow.

14
00:01:11.869 --> 00:01:17.909
He was afraid he'd slip.

15
00:01:17.910 --> 00:01:21.147
"What are we doing out here?" Ethan asked.

16
00:01:21.148 --> 00:01:25.762
"There are so many ways to play in the snow!" Nina said.

17
00:01:25.763 --> 00:01:31.031
"Today we're playing snowy tug-of-war," said their teacher.

18
00:01:31.032 --> 00:01:35.509
"Jason and Ethan, you're a team," Miss Shelly instructed.

19
00:01:35.510 --> 00:01:39.190
"Bobby, Nina, and Izzie, you're a team.

20
00:01:39.191 --> 00:01:43.277
Together choose a team name and a team color."

21
00:01:43.278 --> 00:01:46.063
Bobby groaned.

22
00:01:46.064 --> 00:01:50.138
"Why am I on the girls' team?"

23
00:01:50.139 --> 00:01:53.867
"Are you good at tug-of-war?" Ethan asked Jason.

24
00:01:53.868 --> 00:01:56.193
Jason shook his head.

25
00:01:56.194 --> 00:01:58.761
"I stink," he said.

26
00:01:58.762 --> 00:02:03.269
"Great. Let's be the Stinkers," Ethan said.

27
00:02:03.270 --> 00:02:09.825
"Ha-ha! Okay. And our team color will be green," said Jason.

28
00:02:09.826 --> 00:02:14.418
"Get ready to lose to the Purple Daisies," Izzie cried.

29
00:02:14.419 --> 00:02:21.827
"Prepare for the power of the Green Stinkers!" Jason shot back.

30
00:02:21.828 --> 00:02:23.957
Bobby shook his head.

31
00:02:23.958 --> 00:02:32.302
"I can't believe I'm on a team called the Purple Daisies."

32
00:02:32.303 --> 00:02:36.598
"Purple Daisies, draw your team line in the snow."

33
00:02:36.599 --> 00:02:40.705
Miss Shelly handed Nina a bottle filled with purple liquid.

34
00:02:40.706 --> 00:02:44.216
"What's this?" Nina asked.

35
00:02:44.217 --> 00:02:49.821
"Snow paint, which is food coloring mixed with water," she said.

36
00:02:49.822 --> 00:02:53.763
"Where do the team lines go?" Bobby asked.

37
00:02:53.764 --> 00:02:56.867
Miss Shelly held up a tape measure.

38
00:02:56.868 --> 00:03:03.088
"They should be two meters apart and two meters long," she said.

39
00:03:03.089 --> 00:03:09.402
Ethan and Nina drew their lines in the snow.

40
00:03:09.403 --> 00:03:12.191
"This is the center of the rope."

41
00:03:12.192 --> 00:03:16.002
Miss Shelly pointed to a flag tied to the rope.

42
00:03:16.003 --> 00:03:20.335
"The first team to pull the flag over their line wins.

43
00:03:20.336 --> 00:03:24.444
The only other rule is that no one can fall down!

44
00:03:24.445 --> 00:03:28.442
If anyone does, the other team wins!"

45
00:03:28.443 --> 00:03:31.072
Ethan looked down at his boots.

46
00:03:31.073 --> 00:03:34.779
"No one can fall?" he thought, worried.

47
00:03:34.780 --> 00:03:38.650
"Line up and get ready!" Miss Shelly called.

48
00:03:38.651 --> 00:03:45.899
"The strongest person goes in the back," Bobby said.

49
00:03:45.900 --> 00:03:49.906
"We can do it!" Ethan whispered to Jason.

50
00:03:49.907 --> 00:03:54.724
Miss Shelly blew her whistle. "Go!"

51
00:03:54.725 --> 00:03:58.112
Right away Ethan felt a strong tug.

52
00:03:58.113 --> 00:04:01.036
Ethan and Jason stumbled forward.

53
00:04:01.037 --> 00:04:04.888
"Oh, no you don't," Ethan grumbled.

54
00:04:04.889 --> 00:04:07.855
Ethan dug his boots into the snow.

55
00:04:07.856 --> 00:04:10.978
He squeezed his eyes shut and pulled hard.

56
00:04:10.979 --> 00:04:13.605
He and Jason stepped back.

57
00:04:13.606 --> 00:04:17.005
They were moving the flag toward their team line!

58
00:04:17.006 --> 00:04:18.996
He tugged harder.

59
00:04:18.997 --> 00:04:23.326
But then the Purple Daisies gave a huge tug!

60
00:04:23.327 --> 00:04:28.499
Ethan slipped and landed on his back in the snow.

61
00:04:28.500 --> 00:04:30.864
"Purple Daisies win!

62
00:04:30.865 --> 00:04:36.171
Green Stinkers lose!" Izzie shouted.

63
00:04:36.172 --> 00:04:41.021
Ethan laughed. Falling in the snow wasn't bad.

64
00:04:41.022 --> 00:04:42.672
It was fun!

65
00:04:42.673 --> 00:04:53.401
He stood up and yelled, "Let's play again!"
